</$list>"},"$:/plugins/huwiki/tegne/home-da":{"title":"$:/plugins/huwiki/tegne/home-da","type":"text/vnd.tiddlywiki","text":"<div class="hu-tegne-app">

<section class="hu-tegne-intro">
<h1>HUWiki Tegne</h1>

<p>Et redigerbart tegneatelier med Excalidraw. Figurer og streger gemmes i dine egne TiddlyWiki-tiddlere.</p>

<div class="hu-tegne-actions">
<$button class="hu-tegne-primary">
<$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-new"/>
＋ Ny tegning
</$button>
<$button>
<$action-sendmessage $message="tm-save-wiki"/>
Gem wikien
</$button>
<$link to="Tegne · Udgivelse">Sådan udgiver du tegninger</$link>
</div>

<p class="hu-tegne-note">Tegnemotoren følger med i HTML-wikien og kræver ikke Google-login. Husk at gemme selve wikien efter redigering.</p>
</section>

<$list filter="[{$:/temp/huwiki/tegne/selected}!is[blank]]" variable="drawing">
<section class="hu-tegne-editor">
<header>
<h2><$text text=<<drawing>>/></h2>
<div class="hu-tegne-actions">
<$button><$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-copy" $param=<<drawing>>/>Duplikér</$button>
<$button><$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-source" $param=<<drawing>>/>Hent .excalidraw</$button>
<$button><$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-close"/>Luk</$button>
</div>
</header>
<$excalidraw tiddler=<<drawing>> width="100%" height="640px" autoFocus="no"/>
<p class="hu-tegne-note">Tegningen er redigerbar her i wikien. Brug TiddlyWikis Gem-funktion for at gemme ændringer til HTML-filen.</p>
</section>
</$list>

<section class="hu-tegne-library">
<h2>Tegninger i denne wiki</h2>

<p>Åbn en tegning, eller lav en kopi, du kan ændre uden at overskrive originalen.</p>

<div class="hu-tegne-grid">
<$list filter="[tag[HUWiki/Tegning]!has[draft.of]sort[title]]" emptyMessage="""<p>Der er endnu ingen tegninger. Vælg <strong>Ny tegning</strong> for at begynde.</p>""">
<article class="hu-tegne-card">
<h3><$text text=<<currentTiddler>>/></h3>
<p><$view field="hu-description"/></p>
<div class="hu-tegne-actions">
<$button class="hu-tegne-primary"><$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-open" $param=<<currentTiddler>>/>Åbn</$button>
<$button><$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-copy" $param=<<currentTiddler>>/>Lav kopi</$button>
</div>
</article>
</$list>
</div>
</section>

</div>"},"$:/plugins/huwiki/tegne/home-en":{"title":"$:/plugins/huwiki/tegne/home-en","type":"text/vnd.tiddlywiki","text":"<div class="hu-tegne-app">

<section class="hu-tegne-intro">
<h1>HUWiki Draw</h1>

<p>An editable Excalidraw studio. Shapes and strokes are stored in your own TiddlyWiki tiddlers.</p>

<div class="hu-tegne-actions">
<$button class="hu-tegne-primary">
<$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-new"/>
＋ New drawing
</$button>
<$button>
<$action-sendmessage $message="tm-save-wiki"/>
Save wiki
</$button>
<$link to="Tegne · Udgivelse">Publishing drawings</$link>
</div>

<p class="hu-tegne-note">The editor is bundled with the HTML wiki and needs no Google account. Remember to save the wiki after editing.</p>
</section>

<$list filter="[{$:/temp/huwiki/tegne/selected]!is[blank]]" variable="drawing">
<section class="hu-tegne-editor">
<header>
<h2><$text text=<<drawing>>/></h2>
<div class="hu-tegne-actions">
<$button><$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-copy" $param=<<drawing>>/>Duplicate</$button>
<$button><$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-source" $param=<<drawing>>/>Download .excalidraw</$button>
<$button><$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-close"/>Close</$button>
</div>
</header>
<$excalidraw tiddler=<<drawing>> width="100%" height="640px" autoFocus="no"/>
<p class="hu-tegne-note">This is an editable drawing in your wiki. Use TiddlyWiki's Save action to keep edits in the HTML file.</p>
</section>
</$list>

<section class="hu-tegne-library">
<h2>Drawings in this wiki</h2>

<p>Open a drawing or duplicate it to experiment without replacing the original.</p>

<div class="hu-tegne-grid">
<$list filter="[tag[HUWiki/Tegning]!has[draft.of]sort[title]]" emptyMessage="""<p>No drawings yet. Choose <strong>New drawing</strong> to begin.</p>""">
<article class="hu-tegne-card">
<h3><$text text=<<currentTiddler>>/></h3>
<p><$view field="hu-description"/></p>
<div class="hu-tegne-actions">
<$button class="hu-tegne-primary"><$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-open" $param=<<currentTiddler>>/>Open</$button>
<$button><$action-sendmessage $message="hu-tegne-copy" $param=<<currentTiddler>>/>Duplicate</$button>
</div>
</article>
</$list>
</div>
</section>

</div>"},"$:/plugins/huwiki/tegne/style.css":{"title":"$:/plugins/huwiki/tegne/style.css","type":"text/css","text":"/* HUWiki Tegne 1.1.0-test.1 · Forge test interface; no extra language selector */
.hu-tegne-app{--hu-ink:#182c36;--hu-line:#d9e2e7;--hu-accent:#17699b;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--hu-ink);max-width:1280px;margin:auto}
.hu-tegne-app h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.4rem);margin:.2em 0}
.hu-tegne-app h2{font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2vw,1.8rem);margin:.2em 0 1em}
.hu-tegne-app h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin:.2em 0 .65em}
.hu-tegne-intro{padding:clamp(1em,3vw,2em);border:1px solid var(--hu-line);border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f0f8ff,#fff);margin-bottom:1.8em}
.hu-tegne-actions{display:flex;gap:.65em;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hu-tegne-actions .tc-btn-invisible,.hu-tegne-actions button{border:1px solid #aac4d4;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:var(--hu-ink);padding:.65em .9em;font-weight:600;min-height:42px;cursor:pointer}
.hu-tegne-actions button.hu-tegne-primary{background:var(--hu-accent);color:white;border-color:var(--hu-accent)}
.hu-tegne-note{font-size:.88rem;color:#526b78;margin:.8em 0}
.hu-tegne-editor{border:1px solid #b9d6e5;border-radius:14px;padding:clamp(.6em,2vw,1.3em);margin:1.5em 0;background:#fff}
.hu-tegne-editor header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1em;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:1em}
.hu-tegne-editor .excalidraw{min-width:0}
.hu-tegne-library{margin-top:2em}
.hu-tegne-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(240px,100%),1fr));gap:1em}
.hu-tegne-card{border:1px solid var(--hu-line);background:#fcfefe;padding:1em;border-radius:12px}
.hu-tegne-card .hu-tegne-actions button{font-size:.9em}
@media(max-width:650px){.hu-tegne-editor header{display:block}.hu-tegne-editor{padding:.5em}.hu-tegne-actions{gap:.4em}}
